# False positives: Trivy cannot resolve the dex pseudo-version
# (v0.0.0-20261007...) back to the actual release tag v2.46.0.
# All three CVEs were fixed in versions well below v2.46.0 (2.27.0 / 2.35.0).
CVE-2020-26290
CVE-2020-27847
CVE-2022-39222

# oauth2-proxy v7.15.5 (latest upstream) ships a binary built with Go stdlib 1.26.8
# and golang.org/x/net v0.59.0. We cannot rebuild it, so these are ignored until
# upstream releases a fixed image. exp: makes Trivy fail again if still unfixed.
# Remove each line once Dependabot bumps oauth2-proxy past the fix.

# Go stdlib 1.26.8 -> fixed in 1.26.10 / 1.27.3
CVE-2026-111943 exp:2026-12-31
# Go stdlib 1.26.8 -> fixed in 1.26.9 / 1.27.2
CVE-2026-78667 exp:2026-12-31
# Go stdlib 1.26.8 -> 1.26.9 / 1.27.2, and golang.org/x/net v0.59.0 -> v0.60.0
CVE-2026-78669 exp:2026-12-31
# Go stdlib 1.26.8 -> fixed in 1.26.9 / 1.27.2
CVE-2026-97031 exp:2026-12-31
